#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"On a touch screen a tap opens a file or folder in Dolphin and on the "
"desktop, while the mouse keeps its own setting: a double click, or one click "
"if you choose that in General Behavior.<nl/><nl/>On a computer with a touch "
"screen of its own, the on-screen keyboard is Plasma Keyboard, in your "
"language. It opens when you touch a text field in tablet mode, and in tablet "
"mode the panels hide by themselves and come back as they were when you leave "
"it."
msgstr ""

