msgid ""
"Your whole desktop in 3D, on the 3D screen you already have: a 3D TV or "
"projector, a VR headset, a glasses-free 3D display, or any monitor with red-"
"cyan glasses. On a 2D monitor it is the desktop you know.<nl/><nl/>Each "
"screen is turned to 3D in System Settings, Display Configuration.<nl/><nl/"
">Sparky Stereo OS is Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "
"“pavroo” Pijanowski), with KDE Plasma."
msgstr ""
